WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:10.260
Hey youtubers, it’s charlie.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.929
Time for my Game of Thrones Season 4 Preview
for Theon.

00:00:12.929 --> 00:00:17.490
I hope you’re not to squeamish, because
this is probably going to get messy.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.890
ewwww

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:26.160
So I’m in the middle of a trip to new york,
so hopefully you’re seeing this in a timely

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.160
manner.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.320
Spoilers for everything in seasons 1 through
3 and the partial spoilers for book 5.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:37.350
So Theon’s story has been altered a lot
from the books.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:43.720
Season 3 presumably follows the first half
of events from Book 3, but because David Benioff

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:48.780
and DB Weiss still wanted to use the actor
that plays theon they added a lot of scenes

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.899
that we never saw in the books.

00:00:52.899 --> 00:00:59.630
In the books we don’t meet Theon until the
beginning of Book 5 and by then he’s already

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:00.870
been tortured and turned into Reek.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:05.280
So part of the horror of his situation is
him remembering all of his torture in his

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:06.280
POV chapters.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.640
So season 3 just literally showed us some
of his journey from Theon to Reek.

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:13.930
And I don’t know about you but I’m not
a huge fan of horror, so I did have to turn

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:14.930
away a few times.

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:20.220
Since they spent so much time in that torture
chamber in season 3 I think that just to speed

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:26.369
things along they’ll use most of Theon’s
story from Book 5, so that he’ll be traveling

00:01:26.369 --> 00:01:29.340
around with Ramsay Snow as Reek.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:35.869
They probably won’t change his appearance
too much, but in the books it said that people

00:01:35.869 --> 00:01:37.979
that knew Theon didn’t recognize him as
reek.

00:01:37.979 --> 00:01:41.800
But Ramsay Snow pretty much treats him like
an animal, so if you remember how the Brave

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:44.600
companions treated Jaime after they cut his
hand off, that’s pretty much what it’s

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.820
going to be like between Ramsay Snow and Theon
for the duration of season 4.

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.380
If you remember Tyrion’s disfigurement after
the battle of blackwater bay too, they really

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:54.150
toned it down from the books, so since Theon
is supposed to look like an old man after

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:57.910
he becomes reek I think they’ll tone that
down too so that the actor is still recognizable.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:01.960
Even if you haven’t read the books what
did you think about the scenes with him getting

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:02.960
tortured last year?

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:03.960
Do you think it was necessary?

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:07.030
Or would you have rather they have just shown
the body parts that Ramsay Snow kept mailing

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:08.030
people.

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:10.729
Sometimes when you don’t show something
it comes across as waay worse just because

00:02:10.729 --> 00:02:12.150
your imagination fills in the blanks.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:13.870
So let’s jump deep into season 4.

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:19.459
If you remember, his sister left to rescue
him at the end of Season 3, in the books she

00:02:19.459 --> 00:02:34.390
eventually gets capture by stannis’ fleet
before they make it to the wall.

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:38.170
If you haven’t seen it, I just did a video
for Stannis in season 4.

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:40.530
So watch that if you want to learn more about
Stannis at the wall.

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:43.629
Since Ramsay Snow eventually gets captured
by Stannis while Theon is with him, I think

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:54.050
they’ll just accelerate this so that by
the time Stannis makes it to the wall with

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:58.160
his fleet, both Theon and his sister will
be with him.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:02.040
But what will theon be doing while all this
is happening?

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:06.270
There’s a whole wedding subplot that may
or may not play out.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:11.200
Because Theon is considered a minor character
they might not give it a full scene.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:15.360
Most of the minor characters like Theon and
Sam do get their major moments, but most of

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:16.450
their story happens off screen.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:21.250
I wouldn’t consider Theon being sent to
stannis’ army as an escape for him, since

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:29.599
he can’t undo the mental and physical damage
that was done to him, but after hitting rock

00:03:29.599 --> 00:03:38.769
bottom he does start to regain some of his
humanity and remember who he is.

00:03:38.769 --> 00:03:50.269
If I didn’t make it clear before, all that
torture actually does make him forget who

00:03:50.269 --> 00:03:58.230
he is for a while.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:03.040
That’s where that name Reek comes from.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:15.830
He basically gets brainwashed, but I only
think we’ll see a little of that in season

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:16.830
4.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:20.910
Let me know what you think though.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:31.689
How much of Reek Theon will we see in season
4?

00:04:31.689 --> 00:04:41.560
And how much longer will he be in that dungeon?

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:47.809
Do you think he’ll stay in the dungeon till
season 5 and all of his scenes from book 5

00:04:47.809 --> 00:04:48.809
won’t happen.

00:04:48.809 --> 00:05:02.379
I think they’ll add a lot of implied scenes
and yes he will be in the dungeon through

00:05:02.379 --> 00:05:03.379
the first few episodes.

00:05:03.379 --> 00:05:10.439
But I do think that he’ll make it to the
wall with Stannis and his sister in tow.

